<title>USA: HealthCor acquires Louisiana firm.</title>
<headline>HealthCor acquires Louisiana firm.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthCor Holdings Inc said on Monday that it has acquired Southern Medical Mart Inc, a Louisiana home health company.</p>
<p>Southern Medical generated total revenues of approximately $6.3 million in 1995 and $4 million for the seven months ended July 1996, HealthCor said.</p>
<p>HealthCor Holdings did not disclose the value of deal.</p>
</text>
